  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UcbujPf.png\" width=\"1040\" height=\"284\"></p><p>這個材質包將無聊的生成蛋，替換為裝在箱子裡的可愛生物！非常適合地圖製作者或模組包創作者，想要以更沉浸的方式將生物提供給玩家。或者，只是想在創造模式背包裡增添一點可愛元素。</p><p>與原創作者 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nocubeyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoCube</a>（他創作了精彩的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagers-sell-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villagers Sell Animals Mod</a>）合作製作。<span style=\"font-size:large\"> </span>這個材質包以原版風格擴展了原始概念，快去看看吧！（需要 Forge）</p><p>未完成的生物：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>僅能透過指令生成的生物</strong>：終界龍、凋零怪</p>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YrpDeRv.png\" alt=\"展示（大部分）箱子\" width=\"1512\" height=\"945\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vThDoeg.png\" alt=\"展示放在背包中的箱子\" width=\"1512\" height=\"945\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nwRr6oB.png\" alt=\"掉落在地面上\" width=\"1512\" height=\"945\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"更多內容\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BehR5p7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-default-style-christmas-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTdgpYI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-winter-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sU8jEWl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mushrooms-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I44ugv6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/villager-ravager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vVFn56b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a></p><p>模組材質重製：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-3d-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bEDnkof.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gqxSiwm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7k0IzpZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"315\"></a></p>",
